{"asset_key":"ep5/gameplay_story_15603100","episode":"ep5","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"15603100","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1560310001:1":{"text":"呼……这些材料应该足够了！接下来，只要确定要做什么玩具，再找祖娅帮忙就好了。","source_cn":"呼……这些材料应该足够了！接下来，只要确定要做什么玩具...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2836B2BEC2CC001B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1560310002:1":{"text":"亮亮的、温暖的东西……我想到了！","source_cn":"亮亮的、温暖的东西……我想到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45C5BDE6A516A71D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1560310003:0":{"text":"还记得因度厄送给我们的夜灯吗？我们可以为戴蒙制作一盏鹰蛾造型的灯呀。","source_cn":"还记得因度厄送给我们的夜灯吗？我们可以为戴蒙制作一盏鹰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B0ADCC73F393087","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1560310004:1":{"text":"你说得对，灯的确很符合戴蒙的要求。材料都找到了，现在只缺燃芯了。","source_cn":"你说得对，灯的确很符合戴蒙的要求。材料都找到了，现在只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CB3C5A82D8BD252","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1560310005:1":{"text":"那我们这就去商店买！","source_cn":"那我们这就去商店买！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41D8F968B3D2F7A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_t